= Another Offensive

On the 15th of June <span style="color: #ffd919;">K.</span><span style ="color: #000000;">u.</span><span style="color: #ce2939;">K.</span> troops begin another offfensive on the <span style="color: #008C45;">It</span><span style ="color:#F4F9FF;">al</span><span style="color: #CD212A;">ian</span> front, specifically attempting to cross the Piave river. 

- @hope: We can only hope the best for our soldiers

