on-arrival: workers_sdap += 4; soldiers_sdap +=6

**Defeat**

The offensive ends in defeat. Although initial victories were made, our forces were eventually pushed back to their original postitions by the enemy. The heavy {!<span class="tooltip-text" title="over 80.000 wounded">casualties</span>!} on our side make another offensive on this front unlikely, as our army will likely be fighting on the defensive for the rest of the war.

